{"name": "WF-INV-03: Agente Negociacion Autonomo V10", "nodes": [{"parameters": {}, "id": "webhook-deal", "name": "Deal Stage Webhook", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [250, 300], "webhookId": "deal-negotiation-v10", "path": "deal-negotiation-v10", "responseMode": "responseNode", "options": {}}, {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const payload = $input.first().json.body;\nreturn {\n  deal_id: payload.deal_id,\n  stage: payload.stage, // 'negotiation' trigger\n  company_id: payload.company_id,\n  contact_email: payload.contact_email,\n  contact_name: payload.contact_name,\n  proposed_value: payload.proposed_value,\n  product_tier: payload.product_tier,\n  previous_deals_count: payload.previous_deals_count || 0,\n  industry: payload.industry,\n  company_size: payload.company_size\n};"}, "id": "parse-deal", "name": "Parse Deal Data", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [450, 300]}, {"parameters": {"method": "GET", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/enrich/company/{{ $json.company_id }}", "options": {}}, "id": "enrich-company", "name": "Enrich Company Data", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [650, 300]}, {"parameters": {"method": "GET", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/benchmarks/pricing/{{ $json.industry }}/{{ $json.product_tier }}", "options": {}}, "id": "fetch-benchmarks", "name": "Fetch Pricing Benchmarks", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [850, 300]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/ai/analyze-deal", "sendBody": true, "contentType": "json", "body": {"deal": "={{ JSON.stringify($input.first().json) }}", "benchmarks": "={{ JSON.stringify($input.all()[1].json) }}", "instruction": "Analizar si el valor propuesto est\u00c3\u00a1 dentro del rango autorizado. Si es menor al floor price, recomendar rechazo. Si est\u00c3\u00a1 dentro del 10% del benchmark, aprobar autom\u00c3\u00a1tico. Si es mayor al ceiling, escalar a humano."}, "options": {}}, "id": "ai-analyze", "name": "AI Deal Analysis", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [1050, 300]}, {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const analysis = $input.first().json;\nconst deal = $input.all()[0].json;\n\nlet decision = analysis.decision; // 'auto_approve', 'auto_reject', 'needs_approval'\nlet final_price = deal.proposed_value;\nlet discount_pct = 0;\n\nif (decision === 'auto_approve' && analysis.suggested_discount) {\n  discount_pct = analysis.suggested_discount;\n  final_price = deal.proposed_value * (1 - discount_pct/100);\n}\n\nreturn {\n  ...deal,\n  ...analysis,\n  decision,\n  final_price: Math.round(final_price),\n  discount_pct,\n  requires_human: decision === 'needs_approval',\n  auto_negotiated: decision === 'auto_approve'\n};"}, "id": "logic-switch", "name": "Logic Switch: Decision", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1250, 300]}, {"parameters": {"conditions": {"options": {"caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict"}, "conditions": [{"id": "cond-auto", "leftValue": "={{ $json.decision }}", "rightValue": "auto_approve", "operator": {"type": "string", "operation": "equals"}}]}}, "id": "router-decision", "name": "Router: Decision", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1450, 300]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/docusign/send", "sendBody": true, "contentType": "json", "body": {"template_id": "saas_contract_v10", "recipient_email": "={{ $json.contact_email }}", "recipient_name": "={{ $json.contact_name }}", "deal_value": "={{ $json.final_price }}", "custom_fields": {"company": "={{ $json.company_id }}", "tier": "={{ $json.product_tier }}", "discount": "={{ $json.discount_pct }}%"}}, "options": {}}, "id": "send-docusign", "name": "Send DocuSign/PandaDoc", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [1650, 150]}, {"parameters": {"sendTo": "={{ $json.contact_email }}", "subject": "Oferta aprobada: {{ $json.product_tier }} a \u00e2\u201a\u00ac{{ $json.final_price }}/mes", "text": "Hola {{ $json.contact_name }},\n\nBuenas noticias: tu oferta fue aprobada autom\u00c3\u00a1ticamente.\n\nPlan: {{ $json.product_tier }}\nValor final: \u00e2\u201a\u00ac{{ $json.final_price }}/mes\nDescuento aplicado: {{ $json.discount_pct }}%\n\nAdjunto encontrar\u00c3\u00a1s el contrato para firma electr\u00c3\u00b3nica.\n\nFirm\u00c3\u00a1 y empezamos en 24h.\n\n\u00e2\u20ac\u201d V10V", "options": {}}, "id": "email-approved", "name": "Email: Offer Approved", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendEmail", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1850, 150]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/slack/alerts", "sendBody": true, "contentType": "json", "body": {"channel": "#sales-escalation", "message": "\u00f0\u0178\u201d\u00b4 DEAL REQUIERE APROBACION: {{ $json.contact_name }} / {{ $json.company_id }}\nValor propuesto: \u00e2\u201a\u00ac{{ $json.proposed_value }}\nBenchmark rango: \u00e2\u201a\u00ac{{ $json.benchmark_floor }}-{{ $json.benchmark_ceiling }}\nRaz\u00c3\u00b3n: {{ $json.escalation_reason }}\n\nAprobar: [LINK]\nRechazar: [LINK]"}, "options": {}}, "id": "slack-escalation", "name": "Slack: Escalation Alert", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [1650, 450]}, {"parameters": {"sendTo": "={{ $json.contact_email }}", "subject": "Tu propuesta est\u00c3\u00a1 en revisi\u00c3\u00b3n \u00e2\u20ac\u201d respuesta en 24h", "text": "Hola {{ $json.contact_name }},\n\nRecibimos tu propuesta de \u00e2\u201a\u00ac{{ $json.proposed_value }}/mes.\n\nEst\u00c3\u00a1 siendo evaluada por nuestro equipo de Revenue.\n\nTe respondemos en 24h como m\u00c3\u00a1ximo.\n\n\u00e2\u20ac\u201d V10V", "options": {}}, "id": "email-pending", "name": "Email: Pending Approval", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sendEmail", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1850, 450]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/crm/deals/{{ $json.deal_id }}/update", "sendBody": true, "contentType": "json", "body": {"status": "={{ $json.decision === 'auto_approve' ? 'contract_sent' : 'pending_approval' }}", "negotiated_value": "={{ $json.final_price }}", "auto_negotiated": "={{ $json.auto_negotiated }}", "requires_approval": "={{ $json.requires_human }}"}, "options": {}}, "id": "crm-update-deal", "name": "CRM: Update Deal", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [2050, 300]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "={{ $env.V10V_API_URL }}/api/analytics/feedback", "sendBody": true, "contentType": "json", "body": {"event": "negotiation_completed", "deal_id": "={{ $json.deal_id }}", "decision": "={{ $json.decision }}", "final_price": "={{ $json.final_price }}", "discount_pct": "={{ $json.discount_pct }}", "auto": "={{ $json.auto_negotiated }}", "timestamp": "={{ new Date().toISOString() }}"}, "options": {}}, "id": "feedback-loop", "name": "Feedback Loop", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.1, "position": [2250, 300]}], "connections": {"Deal Stage Webhook": {"main": [[{"node": "Parse Deal Data", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Parse Deal Data": {"main": [[{"node": "Enrich Company Data", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Enrich Company Data": {"main": [[{"node": "Fetch Pricing Benchmarks", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Fetch Pricing Benchmarks": {"main": [[{"node": "AI Deal Analysis", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "AI Deal Analysis": {"main": [[{"node": "Logic Switch: Decision", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Logic Switch: Decision": {"main": [[{"node": "Router: Decision", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Router: Decision": {"main": [[{"node": "Send DocuSign/PandaDoc", "type": "main", "index": 0}], [{"node": "Slack: Escalation Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Send DocuSign/PandaDoc": {"main": [[{"node": "Email: Offer Approved", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Email: Offer Approved": {"main": [[{"node": "CRM: Update Deal", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Slack: Escalation Alert": {"main": [[{"node": "Email: Pending Approval", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "Email: Pending Approval": {"main": [[{"node": "CRM: Update Deal", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "CRM: Update Deal": {"main": [[{"node": "Feedback Loop", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}}, "settings": {"executionOrder": "v1"}, "staticData": null, "tags": [{"name": "v10v-certified", "color": "#d4af37"}, {"name": "ingresos", "color": "#00d084"}, {"name": "INV-03", "color": "#4ecdc4"}], "meta": {"roi_data": {"time_reduction_negotiation": "70%", "deals_auto_closed": "60% dentro de rango", "escalation_accuracy": "95% (solo fuera de rango escala)", "estimated_roi": "1500-2000% en 12 meses"}, "differentiator": "Negocia dentro de rangos pre-autorizados sin intervenci\u00c3\u00b3n humana. Benchmarks por industria y tier. Escalaci\u00c3\u00b3n inteligente con contexto completo al humano.", "complexity_score": 9.2, "estimated_build_time_hours": 8, "price_target": "$500-800/mes administrado", "requires_integrations": ["CRM", "DocuSign/PandaDoc", "Slack", "AI Provider"], "status": "ready-for-deploy"}}
